  "pre_gate_answer": "# Briefing\n\n## Question\n**In BERS RFP 2024-003 for investment consulting services, how many maximum evaluation points are assigned to the annual fee proposal?**\n\n## Finding\n**The maximum evaluation points for the annual fee proposal cannot be determined from the provided evidence.**\n\n## Evidence Reviewed\n- Section **4.4, “Fee Proposal,”** requires respondents to submit:\n  - a **fixed maximum annual fee**\n  - a **variable hourly rate schedule** for special projects\n- The visible portion of the evaluation table shows other categories, including:\n  - **Program Plan/Narrative — 18 points**\n  - **Organizational Capacity / Knowledge and Experience — 23 points**\n  - **Demonstrated Effectiveness** — point value not fully visible\n- The row for **“Annual Fee Proposal”** is **not shown** in the provided excerpts.\n\n## Conclusion\nBecause the relevant evaluation-table row is missing, **the exact maximum points assigned to the annual fee proposal are not available from the supplied evidence**.",
